WEBVTT

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.050
I love you, Kotoko.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.040
Really?

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.830
Say it once more.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.330
Sure.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.420
Serves you right.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.810
A dream?

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.910
I’ve awoken to the same dream everyday since graduation.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:53.690
Ugh, my bed hair...

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.820
I’m still unable to properly face Irie-kun.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.070
But, I shouldn’t be saying such things.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:08.250
Because, I’ll be attending the same university as Irie-kun starting today.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:12.960
Kotoko-chan...

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.860
That suit looks great on you.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:16.980
You really have the air of a college student about you now.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.460
Oh, really?

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:24.730
Morning.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.240
Morning.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:31.190
Look, Onii-chan. Kotoko’s suit looks real cute, doesn’t it?

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:32.240
Oba-sama!

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.230
Mismatched like pearls for pigs.

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:36.600
Pig?

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:43.450
Gosh, Onii-chan! What a terrible thing to say!

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:46.690
Then, clothes make the person, maybe?

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:49.450
I’m going now.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.550
I’ll get going too then.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.450
This is so awkward.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.730
I just don’t know what to say.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.130
Moreover, I don’t understand his attitude.

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.530
Even though we’ve kissed...

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.880
You sure are a blockhead.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:53.550
Wait!

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.420
He called me a blockhead...

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.780
How could you say that to someone you kissed?

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:12.350
Why am I the only one getting flurried?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.740
It makes me look like a fool.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.200
So, I’ll be attending this place for the next four years?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.500
Hey, how long are you going
to keep following me?

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.980
I’m in the science and
engineering department.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:30.010
Oh, really? I’m in the arts department.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.940
See you!

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:36.130
Coming to class with him
from the very first day?

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.450
Morning.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.340
Best regards this year again.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.060
Likewise, best regards.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.520
But, Irie sure hasn’t changed.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.900
Did anything happen during spring break?

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.750
No way. It’s Irie Naoki
we’re talking about here.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:54.870
Well, it might be different with other guys, but with that stiff...

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.590
I wonder about that.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:04:59.640
What is it?

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.490
Well, it wasn’t during spring break though...

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:06.210
Nah, it’s nothing much.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.540
Nothing happened. Forget I said anything.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.870
Hey! Did something really happen?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.060
Something happened? Tell us!

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.050
I wonder if I should...

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:27.050
I don’t really want to tell you two though.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.070
Kiss?!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:41.530
No way! Are you serious?

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:43.130
When and where did it become like that?

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.830
I can’t imagine it!

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.900
You’re too loud!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.410
But, you two kissed, right?

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.020
You’re like a couple now...

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:53.920
But, it was like he was just teasing me.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:56.070
Why are you being so faint-hearted?

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:57.450
It’s a kiss!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.280
I want to tell everyone!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.800
Don’t!

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.780
Kotoko has had good fortune since spring.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.340
Morning, you there.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.480
Where was the arts department again?

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:10.840
Honda and Chiba! Morning.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.680
Hey.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.990
Hey, where’s the arts department?

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.730
Ya-chan and Hiro-kun, you two are also in the arts department?

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:22.130
Kotoko, morning!
You’re in the arts department, right?

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:23.550
Looks like we’ll be together again.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:25.610
Oh, morning everyone.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.640
But, could it be that...

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.660
Get this. The Japanese literature department here...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.760
...is comprised entirely of Class-F from the affiliate high school.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:38.550
Seems that way. That’s why they’re being called the Class-F of the university.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.290
Right on.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.490
How lame.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:49.150
Just when I thought I had finally escaped from the letter F!

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.770
We’re going to have the name “Class-F” again...

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:57.390
That’s right! Even when we’re working, or married, or on our gravestones...

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:02.040
...we’ll definitely be stuck with the Class-F name forever!

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.560
Calm down, Jinko!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.730
Gravestone...

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:08.820
Anyway, let’s head to the classroom.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:11.580
Congratulations on getting in.

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:18.920
There may be some amongst you who think you can
take it easy after getting into university, but...

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.220
...that’s being naïve! Way too naïve!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:25.340
This department especially has many student repeating years!

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:30.020
I predict many students here will be hearing this very speech again next year!

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:32.730
Students! Be sure to study hard!

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.660
Don’t waste the expensive tuition fees!

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.030
Become smarter!

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.650
Got it?!

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:43.880
Don’t let them call you
the Class-F of university!

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.680
That professor was something else.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:50.580
Speaking of which, there were a number of Class-F sempais in our class as well.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.790
That would mean nothing much has changed from last time.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.260
Hey, you pretty ladies over there.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.800
The Ski Association welcomes beauties!

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:02.410
No, please join the Film Research Club.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.700
If you want a club, join the Equestrian Club.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:07.590
I’m from the Music Club.
Would you like to join our band?

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.480
We’re the bright and cheerful Ping Pong Club.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:13.330
You’re very cute, so how about the Announcer Club?

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.140
You there, Miss, how about the Bowling Club?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:19.200
I’m from the Yachting Club. Ride on a yacht in dreamy Hawaiian colors!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.320
We’re your friendly, comedic Rakugo Study Group.

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:26.720
The members of these university clubs are incredible.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.830
The heaven of companionship we’ve been looking forward to, right?

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.540
I wonder if Irie-kun will join something.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:34.530
Obviously he won’t.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.090
I’d like to join the same one as him.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.840
What’s wrong?

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:42.140
No, nothing.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:45.040
I just felt as if someone was looking at me.

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.230
Must be my imagination.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:54.110
This is the Science and Engineering department.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.730
How divine.

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:59.110
For those in the elite courses, eh?

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.450
So, why are we here?

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.570
To search for your darling, of course.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:07.370
Eh? You’re kidding, right?

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.320
What’s wrong with you?
You two have kissed and all.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.230
Then, shall we go take a peek?

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.580
We were planning on doing that already in the first place!

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.120
The Science and Engineering department has nothing but guys.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.140
It’s kinda refreshing.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.600
Hmm, feels like an all-boys school.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:29.850
Ah, Aihara. If you’re looking for Irie, he’s in Room 107.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:35.810
I wasn’t really... Pardon me.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.740
Everyone officially recognizes your relationship now.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.300
You don’t have to worry about other parasites sticking to him then.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:47.140
I wouldn’t get jealous over something so trivial.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:53.040
Here it is! Room 107.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.490
Let’s see.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.280
Don’t push.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:02.240
Wait, who’s that beauty?

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:06.720
Irie is talking to some pretty girl.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:10.100
Who? Who is she?!

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.600
Irie! Your wife is here!

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.030
Is there something you need?

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:29.850
Nah. I was just wondering what the science department was like.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.520
Did he really kiss her?

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.610
How pathetic.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.550
Is she your girlfriend?

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:37.490
Of course not.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.050
“Of course not”?!

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:44.050
So, what was my first kiss about?

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.140
I thought so.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.500
Did she just laugh at me?

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.620
Actually, I’m being laughed at!

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:59.490
Say, Irie-kun. Would you like to have tea later at the café?

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.970
No, thanks. I’ll be going ahead.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:21.510
What the hell is up with that woman?!

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.930
The bath is free.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.580
Umm...

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:41.600
What is it?

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:45.270
The girl in the classroom today...

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:47.220
Ah! Matsumoto Yuuko.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:50.270
You’ve already memorized her full name?

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.930
I’ll remember if I hear it once.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:59.230
How are Matsumoto-san and you...?

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.060
Oh, my. Are you feeling jealous?

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.940
I’m not!

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.740
That’s right. She is pretty.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:14.050
And she seems pretty intelligent as well.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:25.050
She told me she got fifth in the National Mock Exam.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.820
So why is she in our university?

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:36.380
Who knows.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:40.830
That’s odd. Didn’t you say you were going to forget me?

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:45.080
Ah, we’ve already kissed and all, didn’t we?

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:49.680
Kiss?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:59.040
Could this be the second time?

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.070
He was just teasing me!

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:15.480
He doesn’t even care that we’ve kissed before!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:25.030
Really? She’s that amazing of a woman, huh?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.600
She’s like the female version of Irie?

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:29.240
I don’t like that.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.700
So, here’s the cafeteria.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.710
It seems awfully packed.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.670
Good luck then, Kotoko.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.880
We’re going to get a table.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.990
You two brought lunch?

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:52.830
Ma’am, lunch set B, please.

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:53.700
Right away.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:54.990
Curry udon here.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.040
Got it, curry udon, right?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.370
Soba with miso set meal.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:58.560
Please wait.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.640
I have to go in there?

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:06.680
I wonder what I’ll have.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:10.350
Lunch-A is croquettes, Lunch-B is hamburger patties.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.950
The ginger pork is Lunch-C.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.450
The katsu curry looks good,
but the tanuki udon...

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:18.460
Are you only capable of thinking aloud?

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.630
Irie-kun?!

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.460
You don’t have to be so loud.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:32.350
I can’t help but remember
yesterday’s events...

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.720
I’ll have Lunch-A.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.960
I’ll have Lunch-A too!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:39.350
Right away! Lunch-A for two!

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.470
Hey, wait! What’s with this difference in portions?!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.250
What is it, Sir? Do you have a complaint?

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:03.710
Are you saying my fair portion is too little? You sure have some nerve, Mr. Genius.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.540
Kin-chan!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.510
Hey, you’re here, my wife!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:11.870
Wait, that’s not it!
Why are you in the cafeteria?

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:13.850
Aren’t you supposed to be working?

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:17.520
That’s right. I work at your
Dad’s place at night.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.130
And I work at the cafeteria here during the day.

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:22.230
What do you think of my diligence?

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:26.320
I’m earning a good income so you can marry me anytime.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:28.240
Besides, most of all...

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.610
I have to protect you from this devil here.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.860
What d’ya think? So surprised you’re left speechless?

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:37.380
Yes, yes. Very well done.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.200
Ma’am, can you give me more?

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.490
Oh, my. This really is too little.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.700
Ma’am, you don’t have to give him more!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.090
Ah, you’re here!

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:52.470
Irie!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.940
Sudou-san.

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:58.160
I was really surprised when I heard you’re attending this university.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.630
Err, yeah.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:02.340
So, you know what I want, right?

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:03.570
Please!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:04.980
No, I...

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.690
Don’t say that!

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.860
No!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.380
Please! I want you.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.460
What the... Was that a proposal?

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.800
But, they’re both guys.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.860
Eh? You two swing that way?

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:20.820
Really?

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:21.500
Please!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.480
Please stop it.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.690
No! I’ll ask as many times as it takes!

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.000
Irie! I can’t survive without you!

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:35.260
Come on, Irie-kun. I’m begging you.

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:37.660
Fine then.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.910
Really? You accept?

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:43.760
I’m so happy. Just having your name in our club is good enough.

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.790
Club? Like club activities?

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.540
Yes, yes. So, is that all?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.690
Yeah. Sorry for disturbing you.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:54.500
I’ll be waiting for you after class then.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.070
Is he a sempai?

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:58.660
Yeah.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.780
Are you joining some club?

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:01.930
I’m not telling you.

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:03.950
Eh? Why not?

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.970
Because, I have a feeling you’d want to join the same club.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:11.840
How rude! I wouldn’t do such a thing.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.210
I wonder about that.

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:16.720
But, I kinda want to do that.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:27.730
If I stealthily follow him after class, I should be able to find out what club he’s joining.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:29.740
There he is!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.190
Target: locked-on!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:35.550
Are you headed back already?

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:38.240
No, I have some place I have to go to.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:08.230
I wonder how far he’s going.

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:20.160
Slowly... Slowly...

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.660
Irie-kun.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.240
What is it?

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.350
Sheesh, where have you been?

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.670
Matsumoto Yuuko!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:32.990
I was looking for you.

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:33.860
Why?

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:36.920
Did you forget that we’re supposed to go join the club together?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.460
You said that without my agreement.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:42.120
It shouldn’t be a problem since we’re joining the same club, right?

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:45.440
I’m so happy we have a common interest.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:47.530
Hey, keep your hands off him!

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:52.070
Are you a freshman?

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.270
You’re the one from earlier.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.330
Are you joining the tennis club too?

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:58.220
Ah, so this is the tennis club?

00:18:58.220 --> 00:18:59.180
That’s right.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:03.280
I’m so happy. Lately, the number of newcomers has been dwindling.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:07.720
That’s right. Irie-kun won the championship while he was in the tennis club.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:12.580
Please, come on in. We’re having our welcoming party for the new members right now.

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:15.210
How nice!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.360
Wearing an all white tennis skirt.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.950
Irie-kun coaching me.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:27.530
Then frolicking and having fun at a party at night.

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:30.840
Stupid! You’re letting your thoughts slip out your mouth again.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:39.600
Geez. You really don’t know anything, do you?

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:42.030
But, this is the tennis club, isn’t it?

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.140
I’ve always admired tennis.

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:46.070
Do you have any tennis experience?

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:48.680
Ugh! Matsumoto Yuuko.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.290
No, I don’t.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:53.910
You’re planning on joining this club despite having no experience?

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.330
You sure don’t understand.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.720
Understand what?

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:02.880
Welcome, newcomers.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.700
Our tennis club has a long history.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:09.690
Even now, we continue leaving behind many great results.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:14.600
We won the Eastern Division last year as well.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:18.900
We’re ranked third nationally!

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.590
What the hell are you doing?!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:25.610
How can you pick up the balls if you got your eyes closed?!

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:29.620
341, 342...

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:33.780
However, word has been going around that our training is very demanding.

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:37.130
So, in recent years, the number of new members has been dropping.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:42.130
1001, 1002, 1003...

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:43.970
Let’s practice!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:44.630
No!

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:49.390
But, this year, we have the one who won the High School Eastern Division Championship last year,

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.560
Irie Naoki-kun!

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:59.070
And, we were also able to recruit the girl’s runner-up, Matsumoto Yuuko-kun.

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:01.390
A truly joyous event.

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:09.330
Girl’s runner-up?!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:14.790
Certainly, here, we’re not like the stereotypical tennis circles who aim for social parties.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.260
Hey, who said you could stop?!

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:17.960
He’s running away! After him!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:22.680
I’d like you all to work hard
and practice daily.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:24.380
That’s all!

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:32.680
I’ve come to a really bad place.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:09.200
Shall we get going, Irie-kun?

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:12.320
Argh! Why is Matsumoto...?

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:15.530
She’s going to the movies with Irie? We’re going too!

00:23:15.530 --> 00:23:18.010
Sudou-sempai, don’t tell me, we’re gonna tail them?

00:23:18.010 --> 00:23:21.410
Don’t make a fuss! You don’t care
if they end up together?

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:23.080
No! Definitely no!

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:24.170
Let’s go, sempai!

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:26.960
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:28.470
Shoot for a date.

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:29.750
The one who’s...

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:31.310
...going to be happy is me.
